; benchmark.meta description: Zooms Living Herbarium's 1,000 specimens from fit in about tenfold and back by command scrolls, panning between, while 5% of them sway in deform mode with gradients, the demo's defaults, in a real 1440 x 900 window at scale 2 with its toolbar and stats panel, reporting each committed frame's main-thread phases, GPU time and scripted input latency.
; benchmark.meta timing: not-recommended
; benchmark.meta profiles: gui-window
(blank)
(import ./../fixtures/herbarium-bench-fixture)
(import /gui)
(blank)

(main
  (<> App
    (<> HerbariumBenchWindow
      (= script (. HerbariumBenchScript zoom))
      (= moving-steps 180)
      (= result-name "herbarium/window-herbarium-zoom")
    )
  )
)
